      "title": "P2: Intelligence & Quality",
      "items": [
        "Tri-state validation: PASS, FAIL, or explicit INDETERMINATE",
        "Policy engine is pure: never re-reads raw files or invents facts",
        "Transactional cleaning: approval -> temp file -> atomic replace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
